{"unit_id":"Acoder416__dsh-plugin-workbuddy-gateway#feature-1","repo":"Acoder416/dsh-plugin-workbuddy-gateway","commit":"5c86712c84d75bbb0b6f6de51e2143d22a98ca37","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"WorkBuddy Gateway 的功能「接入订阅模型」：在设置页启动或停止本地网关，并可将网关返回的模型写入 DSH 的 WorkBuddy 提供方路由，使其出现在模型选择器中。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.js:780-810","src/client/index.js:982-990","src/index.js:152-163","src/provider-route.js:87-100"]}
{"unit_id":"Acoder416__dsh-plugin-workbuddy-gateway#caveat-1","repo":"Acoder416/dsh-plugin-workbuddy-gateway","commit":"5c86712c84d75bbb0b6f6de51e2143d22a98ca37","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"WorkBuddy Gateway 使用 WorkBuddy 上游接口处理账号授权、模型目录和模型请求；实际联系的服务随所选区域变化，包括 workbuddy.ai 或 codebuddy.cn 相关服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["vendor/workbuddy-gateway/wb_proxy.py:109-112","vendor/workbuddy-gateway/wb_proxy.py:123-130","vendor/workbuddy-gateway/wb_proxy.py:2826-2829"]}
